# Hashish and filtered hashish -- the two cut pieces of the two pressed bars.
#
# Redrawn 2026-09-14 against vanilla's own textures. Generated art, not Warlon Mhite's hand: edit
# freely.
#
# ## One shape, two palettes -- by construction
#
# Both pieces are cut off a pressed bar, and the two bars are the same block in two colours
# (hashish_bar.mctex). So the pieces are one @matrix here with two palettes, and cannot drift apart.
# Colour follows process and never potency: blonde is cleaner, not stronger.
#
# ## Why an oblique slab, and why this thick
#
# Vanilla draws everything pressed in a mould -- brick, nether brick, resin brick, every ingot -- as
# an oblique slab: a top face and two side faces, never an axis-aligned rectangle. The edges step
# exactly 2:1, which is vanilla's slope for it. A first draft was long and thin and read as a plank;
# this one is a cut piece -- an 8x6 top on a 4 px body -- which is what a piece off a bar is.
# (The linter's "outline jumps 1.3 px per row" is expected: vanilla's brick, resin brick, nether
# brick and copper ingot all get the same flag. It is what an oblique slab measures as.)
#
# The top carries two things: the greasy sheen up-left (pressed hash is oily, and one two-pixel
# cluster is where vanilla puts light), and a stamp pressed into its middle with a lit lower lip --
# real slabs carry a maker's stamp, and it is what stops this reading as a brick or a brownie.

@palette hash
. = none
1 = 1B120A      rim, shadow side
2 = 2E2112      rim, lit side
3 = 47321B      the faces' lowest row, in shade
4 = 5C4222      front face
5 = 6B4A2F      the strain entry's own colour: the end face, and the stamp pressed into the top
6 = 86643A      top face
7 = A48048      the lit edge where the top meets the faces, and the stamp's lip
8 = C9A66A      the greasy sheen

@palette blonde
. = none
1 = 4A3418
2 = 6B4E24
3 = 8A6A33
4 = A5813F
5 = B99248
6 = D2B06A
7 = E6CB8E
8 = F7E6B6

@matrix slab 16x16
................
................
................
........21......
......222221....
....2277666221..
..2278665566771.
.27766656457441.
.25577667744441.
.25555774444421.
.1255554444211..
..1125544211....
....112211......
......11........
................
................

@texture item/hashish from=slab palette=hash type=item
@texture item/filtered_hashish from=slab palette=blonde type=item
